  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Freemuse 2007-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Freemuse 2007-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1.Freemuse &#xe4;r en internationell icke vinstdrivande organisation, den enda som arbetar f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja yttrandefrihet f&#xf6;r musiker och komposit&#xf6;rer v&#xe4;rlden &#xf6;ver samt mot musikcensur. Sekretariatet &#xe4;r baserat i K&#xf6;penhamn. Det nuvarande avtalet &#xe4;r konstruerat som ett utfasningsst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att pressa Freemuse att finna nya/fler givare. Sida har st&#xf6;tt Freemuse sedan 2001. F&#xf6;rnyat st&#xf6;d kan &#xf6;verv&#xe4;gas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Freemuse is an international non-profit organisation advocating freedom of expression for musicians and composers world wide. The secretariat based in Copenhagen. Sida has provided core funding to Freemuse since 2001. The present 5-year agreement is constructed as a phase out support in order to pressure Freemuse to find new/more core donors. Renewed support can be considered.</narrative>
  </description>
